<title>POLAND: Budimex to buy two firms in 1997.</title>
<headline>Budimex to buy two firms in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA wants to buy majority or strategic stakes in two specialised construction firms this year, Budimex president said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are planning (to buy) two niche construction firms, we want to do it this year, but we are still holding talks,&quot; Grzegorz Tuderek told Reuters in an interview on Thursday.</p>
<p>He declined to name the firms involved, but said the purchase would finalise the creation of Budimex's holding group. Now the company has 14 subsidiaries and minority stakes in a further 28 firms.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
